# Research Prompt Builder — North Star

The current product ends after generating, validating, and exporting one company-specific ChatGPT research prompt. All architecture and AI operations must directly support the quality, safety, traceability, or usability of that prompt.

## Four outcomes

Accuracy · Specificity · Research Depth · Repeatability

## Do not expand MVP into

Research execution · topics · scripts · video · auth · DB · write MCP · auto-rewriting canon docs

## First steps

1. Prefer `npm run dev` (runs `doctor` then Next.js). Use `npm run doctor` alone for a one-shot check; `npm run verify` before merge.
2. Read `AGENTS.md` and `project-knowledge/CURRENT_STATE.md`
3. Prefer the smallest change that improves the exported prompt
